#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:126 18494e4cce1b44abb4255745ddb239e3
msgid ""
"After starting the OptiTrack stream, verify that the position reported by "
"ArduPilot closely matches the position shown in the OptiTrack (Motive) "
"software."
msgstr "启动 OptiTrack 数据流后，确认 ArduPilot 报告的位置与 OptiTrack（Motive）软件中显示的位置基本一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:128 e55c0d99582d4014853a0833f4e877e3
msgid ""
"Small offsets (a few centimeters) are acceptable. Large discrepancies "
"indicate a configuration issue such as incorrect axis alignment, origin "
"placement, or rigid body setup."
msgstr "几厘米的小偏差是可以接受的。较大的偏差说明存在配置问题，例如轴向对齐、原点放置或刚体设置不正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:130 07103983c8e14babbedf38f3cb3b35eb
msgid ""
"If you see the following message appearing (initial pos may vary), then the "
"drone is receiving pose data from the Optitrack system."
msgstr "如果看到以下消息出现（初始位置可能不同），说明无人机正在接收来自 Optitrack 系统的位姿数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:143 9c6dcea214b54a8498250e9f8ced2850
msgid ""
"In order to take off in Guided, Auto, or RTL modes, a valid GPS global "
"origin must be set using `GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__."
msgstr ""
"要在 Guided、Auto 或 RTL 模式下起飞，必须使用 `GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__ 设置有效的 "
"GPS 全局原点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:146 5e624e115f5647ab8a86a2f64c37f705
msgid ""
"The latitude and longitude do not need to be highly accurate, but they must "
"be valid coordinates. It is recommended to use the approximate latitude and "
"longitude of the building or test facility where the motion capture system "
"is installed (for example, obtained from Google Maps). Altitude can be set "
"to zero or an approximate value."
msgstr ""
"经纬度不需要非常精确，但必须是有效坐标。建议使用动作捕捉系统所在建筑或测试场地的大致经纬度（例如从 Google Maps "
"获取）。高度可以设为零或近似值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optitrack.rst:151 5c390093831240239985b1b1f3431f7b
msgid ""
"The GPS global origin is only used as a reference frame; all position "
"information comes from the OptiTrack system."
msgstr "GPS 全局原点仅用作参考坐标系；所有位置信息均来自 OptiTrack 系统。"
